#. module: bf_school_calendar
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_school_calendar.bf_school_calendar_day_action
msgid ""
"On the school form, the button of a school year makes its class days, Monday to Friday.\n"
"                Then mark the pedagogical days, the breaks and the holidays."
msgstr ""
"Sur la fiche de l'école, le bouton d'une année scolaire crée ses jours de "
"classe, du lundi au vendredi. Marquez ensuite les journées pédagogiques, les"
" congés et les jours fériés."

